<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Wanoga Butte from Edison Sno-Park</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:279-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.932133" lon="-121.598828"><ele>1532.6</ele><name>Edison Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:edison-butte-sno-park (OSM way 878985026 Edison Sno-Park); confidence: high; pdf_page: 279; book_elev_ft: 5080; quote: map 63: B EDISON BUTTE SNO-PARK 5080'</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.924340" lon="-121.605740"><ele>1501.9</ele><name>Light Bulb Loop, north junction</name><desc>source: end of USFS trail 8060.1 Light Bulb Tie / closing vertex of 8060 Light Bulb Loop (the two ends are 5 m apart, not joined); confidence: high; pdf_page: 280; quote: the first 0.3 mile from the sno-park to the loop is really too steep for Novices</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.918350" lon="-121.605150"><ele>1476.0</ele><name>Light Bulb Loop, lower end</name><desc>source: southernmost vertex of USFS trail 8060; confidence: high; pdf_page: 281; book_elev_ft: 4824; quote: descend the east leg of Light Bulb Loop 1.3 miles to its lower end</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.917340" lon="-121.598480"><ele>1470.2</ele><name>Road 45 at road 4500-600</name><desc>source: USFS road 4500600 / OSM way 5352211 meets River Summit Drive (Road 45); the 'unmarked, obscure road' is not identified, straight leg; confidence: low; pdf_page: 281; quote: turn east onto an unmarked, obscure road, and ski the short distance to Road 45</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.919240" lon="-121.597470"><ele>1473.9</ele><name>Road 45 / Road 4188 junction</name><desc>source: start of USFS road 4188000 = OSM way 878985049 Wanoga Lookout Road on River Summit Drive; confidence: high; pdf_page: 281; quote: Cross the highway, ski north to Road 4188 (1 mile below Edison Butte Sno-Park)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.921400" lon="-121.565100"><ele>1602.0</ele><name>Lookout road junction (Road 4188-400)</name><desc>source: OSM way 5371640 Forest Road 400 leaves Wanoga Lookout Road (USFS 4188400 starts 43.92143,-121.56502); confidence: high; pdf_page: 281; quote: ski east 1.7 miles to the lookout road</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.913800" lon="-121.555100"><ele>1736.6</ele><name>Wanoga Butte summit (lookout)</name><desc>source: end of OSM Forest Road 400; OSM node 357317559 Wanoga Butte at 43.913728,-121.555864; confidence: high; pdf_page: 281; book_elev_ft: 5697; quote: climbs in earnest the 430 feet to the top, 1.3 miles off Road 4188</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Wanoga Butte from Edison Sno-Park</name><desc>1. Edison Sno-Park -&gt; Light Bulb Loop, north junction: usfs-trail (high), 0.85 mi | 2. Light Bulb Loop, north junction -&gt; Light Bulb Loop, lower end: usfs-trail (high), 0.48 mi | 3. Light Bulb Loop, lower end -&gt; Road 45 at road 4500-600: straight (low), 0.34 mi | 4. Road 45 at road 4500-600 -&gt; Road 45 / Road 4188 junction: osm (high), 0.15 mi | 5. Road 45 / Road 4188 junction -&gt; Lookout road junction (Road 4188-400): osm (high), 1.72 mi | 6. Lookout road junction (Road 4188-400) -&gt; Wanoga Butte summit (lookout): osm (high), 1.29 mi</desc>
